{"user":"O_oNevermore","message":"> 00:01:09 How many cults actually are there?\n> 00:01:12 It's incredibly hard to measure,\n> 00:01:14 but what we do know is that the number of cults is rising.\n> 00:01:18 So, for example, the International Cultic Studies Association\n> 00:01:21 tracks around 4000 of them worldwide.\n> 00:01:24 While in the 1980s it tracked around 2000.\n> 00:01:28 And France, which is one of the only countries which monitors cult activity.\n> 00:01:33 It has a dedicated watchdog logged more than 4500 and reports\n> 00:01:38 of suspected cult activity in 2024,\n> 00:01:41 which is almost double the level in 2015.\n> 00:01:44 And most of these cases involved communities\n> 00:01:47 which had some sort of an online presence.\n> 00:01:51 And then what's also changing isn't just the volume, but the shape of these cults.\n> 00:01:56 Now they're much more fragmented.\n> 00:01:58 So whereas before you had a few well-defined cults,\n> 00:02:02 now you have thousands of them spread on the internet.","timestamp":"2026-08-02T15:48:02.840000+00:00","channel":"✍️defenders-log","channel_id":"discord:1344687791451275356","thread":null,"thread_id":null,"reply_to":null,"id":"discord:1533501643277078649","user_id":"discord:335107602243518466","is_bot":false,"url":"https://discord.com/channels/1344300408893345863/1344687791451275356/1533501643277078649","attachments":[],"platform":"discord","server":"ORI 1.0 (2025)","server_id":"discord:1344300408893345863"}
